OL,3,GNEWSAYork's main Post Office to close
OL,4,Ain October
OL,5,
OL,6,FYork's main Post Office will close next
OL,7,Fmonth together with the city's TG Jones
OL,8,Fstore.
OL,10,FThe Coney Street branch will shut on 14
OL,11,FOctober, it has been announced.
OL,13,FIt comes after TG Jones' owner Modella
OL,14,FCapital confirmed plans to close up to
OL,15,F150 stores across the UK in July.
OL,17,FIn a statement the Post Office said it
OL,18,Fhoped to open a replacement branch "as
OL,19,Fsoon as possible".
